        ('API contract design', 'An API contract defines routes, methods, payloads, validation, errors and compatibility expectations.', 'Specify required fields and stable error shapes, then test both valid and invalid requests.', 'A change renames a response field used by clients. Version or deprecate it through a documented compatibility period.', 'A paginated endpoint documents cursor and empty-result behavior.'),
